# NOTE: projects/ai_dxos/Strata/.gitignore (nested, faithful copy) contains `*` and
# excludes the whole Strata build from git. That is upstream build-tooling behavior,
# NOT a backup decision. Do NOT "fix" it by editing the nested file; the Strata
# binaries are tracked in this backup's manifests/SHA256SUMS.txt and stay out of git
# on purpose (see docs/git_archive_supplement_20261106.md §5).
